        "text": "def solve(rows):\n  \"\"\"Calculates the expiry days for a list of items, adjusting for weekend expiration.\n\n  Args:\n    rows: A list of lists, where each inner list contains the day and lifetime of an item.\n\n  Returns:\n    A list of expiry days in the same order as the input rows.\n  \"\"\"\n  expiry_days = []\n  for day, lifetime in rows:\n    expiry_day = day + lifetime\n    remainder = expiry_day % 7\n    if remainder == 5:\n      expiry_day += 2  # Move to Monday\n    elif remainder == 6:\n      expiry_day += 1  # Move to Monday\n    expiry_days.append(expiry_day)\n  return expiry_days",
